>> f1 := Fayilo chatsopano: ['notafile'].
>> f2 := Fayilo chatsopano: ['/tmp/test.txt'].
(f2 lilipo) zoona: { f2 chotsani.}.
Zotuluka lembani: f2 njira-ya-fayilo.
f2 lembani: ['Hello!'].
f2 onjeza-kumapeto: ['World!'].
Zotuluka lembani: f2 werengani.
(f2 lilipo) zoona: { Zotuluka lembani: ['!']. }.
(f1 lilipo) zoona: { Zotuluka lembani: ['!']. }.
Zotuluka lembani: f2 kukula, lembani: f1 kukula.
f2 chotsani. Zotuluka lembani: f2 kukula.

